(7703764, 1264925, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ive struggled all week with this entry. It is a cracking mono photo, superbly lit, but I dont understand it.  There is certainly a surreal feel, with the body less legs, and the clock is an obvious trope - but I dont get what it is trying to say.  I wonder if it is a museum exhibit (there is something artificial about the model) or a scene from a play?  At any rate, for this viewer, the photo needs more explanation in the title to make sense for the challenge.</td>', 'Ive struggled all week with this entry. It is a cracking mono photo, superbly lit, but I dont understand it.  There is certainly a surreal feel, with the body less legs, and the clock is an obvious trope - but I dont get what it is trying to say.  I wonder if it is a museum exhibit (there is something artificial about the model) or a scene from a play?  At any rate, for this viewer, the photo needs more explanation in the title to make sense for the challenge.', '2021-10-19 02:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
